sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant L as Laptop Serial Terminal
    participant B as STM32 Nucleo H753ZI

    U->>L: Open serial terminal at 115200 baud
    B->>B: Initialize clock, GPIO, UART
    loop Every N milliseconds
        B->>B: Create dummy telemetry values
        B->>L: Send formatted telemetry string over UART
        L->>U: Show live text output
    end
